# Firebase — MUST be the same project the mobile app uses (larga-614bd), or the
# two clients won't see each other's users, drivers or trips. The real values
# are the ones in larga-mobile/client/src/services/firebase.js; copy this file
# to .env.local and paste them in.
#
# Vite only exposes vars prefixed with VITE_, and everything exposed ends up in
# the browser bundle. That is expected for Firebase web config — these identify
# the project, they don't grant access. Firestore security rules are what
# actually protect the data, so don't put anything secret here.
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
